 * consumption bookkeeping + the consumed-without-work sweep decision
 * (gh-840).
 *
 * Live forensics being replayed: dmtools-agents PR #826 (gh-825),
 * 2026-10-10 ~10:00Z — agent:rework armed (twice) and later CONSUMED with
